      "content": "it's just all so pointless though. what's a \"coping strategy\" gonna do? help me survive another 40 years of moving cardboard just so i can pay rent and die? it feels like the only way to actually win against a system like this is to refuse to play. like, if the only way they control me is through this endless cycle, then maybe the only way to actually have agency is to just... break the cycle entirely. i don't see how any of that \"professional help\" changes the fact that i'm just a cog.",
